msgid ""
"Contained banner hero opens onto a centered text intro, a free-form image "
"grid, and a split title introducing a full image wall, then a square-icon "
"feature showcase and a reviews wall before an image-backed call-to-action, "
"with light serif headings and a rounded boxed header as the recurring visual "
"signature. Narrative and image-forward / suited for travel agencies, tour "
"operators, excursion booking, and destination marketing sites"
msgstr ""

